Descriptor AssessmentPeriod
    documentation 'This descriptor holds the period of time window in which an assessment is 
    'supposed to be administered (e.g., Beginning of Year, Middle of Year, End of 
    'Year).
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The first date the assessment is to be administered.
        is optional
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The last date the assessment is to be administered.
        is optional


